"""Row spec of every lane DS guard table (generated by scripts/pm-ds-table-generate.py).

phase: (title, checker, rows). One row per line: ``ROW | exact refusal code | invariant``.
A row holds when its invariant holds on the complete input; the checker derives
that boolean and refuses only through the table (scripts/pm_ds_tables.py).
Compound conditions are split into one row per predicate; rows that share a
code keep their own predicate. Codes are literal strings: where the original
refusal text carries a value (a size, a field name), the code is the stable
text and the checker formats the original message after the table refuses.
"""

